    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Soldier\u2019s Struggle</i> is a short visual novel about resilience, love, and the healing power of friends. After years away, a young man returns to a life he barely recognizes. As old wounds linger and new challenges emerge, his journey becomes one of rediscovering trust, hope, and the strength found in love. Follow along as he reconnects with his landlady and roommate and explores new aspects of their relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>kinetic novel</strong>, meaning it is a linear, story-driven experience with no choices or branching paths\u2014perfect for players who enjoy a short and sweet story. </p>",
